<title>USA: CBOE to list Lucent LEAPS Nov 18.</title>
<headline>CBOE to list Lucent LEAPS Nov 18.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chicago Board Options Exchange said Friday it will list Long-term Equity AnticiPation Securities (LEAPS) on Lucent Technologies Inc on Nov 18.</p>
<p>The long term options will have expirations in January 1998 and January 1999, with initial strike prices at 40, 50 and 60.</p>
<p>Lucent shares were off 3/8 at 48-3/4 in afternoon trading.</p>
<p>Lucent LEAPS will also trade on American Stock Exchange and Philadelphia Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>--Derivatives desk, 312-408-8750</p>
<p>Email: derivatives@reuters.com</p>
